# Immutable, byte-exact retained third-party evidence artifacts (raw API
# responses / raw fetched documents bound to a SHA-256 checksum for
# provenance). These must never be reformatted, and their inherent
# third-party whitespace/markup is not a repository style issue -- exclude
# them from textual diffing so `git diff --check` reports real whitespace
# problems in code/docs, not formatting choices made by an external
# publisher whose exact bytes we are required to retain unmodified.
docs/poi/evidence/**/*.raw.* -diff
